{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","municipalityCode":"08203","municipalityName":"土浦市","prefectureCode":"08","prefectureName":"茨城県","assignedTeam":"東日本調査班","status":"researching","currentService":"bulkyWaste","nextServiceIndex":7,"completedServices":["childMedical","sickChildCare","childcareFee","schoolMeals","postpartumCare","temporaryChildcare","housingSupport"],"verifiedCount":7,"researchingCount":1,"unavailableCount":0,"needsMediumReviewCount":0,"currentBranch":"data/08203-tsuchiura","pullRequestNumber":null,"lastCheckedAt":"2026-07-20","lastUpdatedAt":"2026-07-20T23:59:30+09:00","lastUpdatedBy":"東日本調査班","officialSources":["https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kurashi-tetsuzuki/kokuho-nenkin/marufuku/kakushu-marufuku/page016824.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kosodate-kyoiku/syussan-kosodate/jidofukushi-boshifushifukushi/page017931.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kosodate-kyoiku/hoiku-gakko/yochien-kodomoen-hoikuen/hoikujo/page012483.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kosodate-kyoiku/hoiku-gakko/gakko-kyoiku/gakko-kyushoku/page017408.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kosodate-kyoiku/syussan-kosodate/boshinokenko-iryo/ninsanpu-jigyo/page012213.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kosodate-kyoiku/syussan-kosodate/jidofukushi-boshifushifukushi/page005741.html","https://www.city.tsuchiura.lg.jp/kankyo-kotsu-machizukuri/toshikeikaku-machizukuri/page006310.html"],"notes":["日立市の地方統合完了後、東日本担当自治体コード順で土浦市を新規選定。","region/eastから自治体専用ブランチを作成。","childMedicalを公式情報で確認済み。","sickChildCareは病児保育室なおるーむとファミリー・サポート・センターの病後児預かりを確認。","childcareFeeは3～5歳児と非課税世帯0～2歳児の無償化、その他0～2歳児保育料の市独自約5％軽減、副食費の第3子以降等免除を確認。","schoolMealsは市立小中学校・義務教育学校23校の給食費を2027年3月分まで無償化していることを確認。","postpartumCareは1歳未満の母子を対象とする短期入所・通所・居宅訪問型、7日以内（多胎10日以内）、非課税・生活保護世帯免除を確認。","temporaryChildcareは公立3施設・民間22施設の一時預かりと、2026年度開始の月10時間こども誰でも通園制度を確認。","housingSupportは中心市街地へ転入する子育て世帯等への家賃・住宅購入借入金補助を確認。","次の対象はbulkyWaste。"],"blockers":[]}
